@HostAddress = https://localhost:7197

### GET all products
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/Products
Accept: application/json

### POST (add) a new product
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/Products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Headphones",
  "price": 3500
}

### Update an existing product (Change '1' to a real ID from your database)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Headphones",
  "price": 9999
}

### Delete a product (Change '2' to a real ID from your database)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/Products/99999